    "faqQuestion1":  "How can I register a pet?",
    "faqAnswer1":  "You can register your pet by going to the \"Add Pet\" section, filling in the required details (name, breed, age, etc.), and attaching a photo. Once registered, you’ll receive a unique QR pet tag ID.",
    "faqQuestion2":  "Why should I register my pet?",
    "faqAnswer2":  "Registering your pet helps in case they get lost. Anyone who finds your pet can scan the QR tag and instantly contact you with the pet’s location.",
    "faqQuestion3":  "QR pet tag activation?",
    "faqAnswer3":  "After registering, you’ll get a digital or physical QR tag. Scan it with any phone camera to link it to your pet’s profile. No app needed for finders!",
    "faqQuestion4":  "How does QR code scanning work?",
    "faqAnswer4":  "Anyone can scan the QR tag using their phone’s camera. It opens a web page with your contact info and pet details so they can reach you immediately.",
    "faqQuestion5":  "Who can register a pet?",
    "faqAnswer5":  "Any pet owner can register their dog, cat, or other companion animal.",
    "faqQuestion6":  "How can I change my data?",
    "faqAnswer6":  "Go to Profile → tap any field (Name, Email, Phone, etc.) to edit and save.",
    "faqQuestion7":  "How can I change my pet\u0027s data?",
    "faqAnswer7":  "Go to your pet’s profile and tap the edit button to update name, breed, photos, etc.",
    "faqQuestion8":  "What is a pet ID number?",
    "faqAnswer8":  "It’s a unique identifier linked to your pet’s QR tag for quick identification.",
    "faqQuestion9":  "My pet is lost what should I do?",
    "faqAnswer9":  "Mark your pet as \"Lost\" in the app. This alerts anyone who scans the tag and shows your emergency contact info.",
